  {
   "id": "catmaze-74686@patch-2018-05-25",
   "gameId": "catmaze-74686",
   "displayName": "First day patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2018-05-25T18:37:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Few, it was a little bit hard to survive :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks everyone for the feedback! Here is some updates I made:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I put a key in the room near the cave where player should follow the cat with glowing ears (key will appear near the left entrance to the cave in the room with barrel);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added some new markers on the map that show where you can find feather of the FireBird (allows you to see in the darkness, marker appears after talk with Voronikha) and where you can find shooting familiar (marker appears after you get feather of the FireBird) and marker that shows the first boss (appears after you receive a weapon to fight him);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed position of some monsters and spikes;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Solved problems with analog stick in Voronikha's shop;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Solved problem with opening the doors in case you changed default controls on keyboard;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed jumping mushrooms;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Character now moves a little bit faster from the very begging.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some mistakes in some dialogs;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added some markers that shows where player can find Svetozara's cats and Chernobog altair's (markers appears after you take these quests);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "I tried to improve perfomance a little bit. I hope it will help;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed controls from keyboard while flying.: Please report me about any bugs - I will try to fix them as soon as I can so you'll be able to enjoy Catmaze.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
